WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.593
P7.1 · The board pack: built once, ready at every close

2
00:00:06.743 --> 00:00:10.263
In Reports, a Board Pack is a report you set up once.

3
00:00:10.313 --> 00:00:15.262
Each month it is rebuilt from the latest closing, same sections, same order.

4
00:00:18.743 --> 00:00:21.715
Consolidated, or with one pack per company.

5
00:00:21.765 --> 00:00:25.725
On Period Close, the month's pack is ready when the close is done.

6
00:00:29.043 --> 00:00:32.959
Next: P7.2  Reconciling what you present

